<title>USA: Wells Fargo to redeem preferred issue.</title>
<headline>Wells Fargo to redeem preferred issue.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wells Fargo &amp; Co said on Thursday it would redeem all outstanding depositary shares representing its Series F preferred stock on Nov 15, 1996.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the redemption price would be $25 per share plus $0.301736 in accrued dividends to the redemption date.  This amount will be paid upon presentation of the depositary shares on or after Nov. 15, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk, (212) 859-1610</p>
